  CollectionHall_100442_Desc = {
    Text = "Born into a wealthy human merchant family, yet coursing through his veins was the blood of a ghoul. This dual heritage granted him a unique talent—the ability to perceive a world invisible to ordinary people. A world mad and absurd, painted in dazzling, intoxicating colours.\nWithout hesitation, Pickman chose to record everything he saw with his brush. He immersed himself completely, honing his skills until his artistry became superlative.\nMainstream aesthetics rejected Pickman utterly; no one could accept his insane visions. Though often saddened by this isolation, he never surrendered.\nIn the end, Pickman embraced Dissolution, awakening the ghoul blood within him fully. He left the human world behind and journeyed to the royal city of the ghouls. One day, he would unveil the fantastic and maddening splendors of the true world to all."
