  CollectionHall_121154_Title = {Text = "Paradise"},
  CollectionHall_121341_Desc = {
    Text = "The \"Princess\" has fully embraced her role: she is now the \"Divine Mother,\" tasked with nurturing the \"Divine Fetus\"—the pivotal being within the Order of the Seafarers. \nShe was once a girl who desperately sought freedom, embarking on the same escape journey aboard the Sona-nyl as documented by Mythag's Murphy. \nYet, in a world devoid of benevolent keepers, fate brutally broke the noble neck of the young swan. \nHer twisted bloodline entangled her without respite; even the death of her body could not offer escape. She forces herself to repeat, again and again, \"I am the noble Divine Mother,\" using the phrase as a mere act of self-suggestion and persuasion. \nOnly obedience remains, only the compulsion to obey. To submit to the false oracle, to yield to the absurd fate. Only then, from the endless bitterness of her existence, can she reluctantly savor a hint of sweet, fleeting fantasy."
  },
