  },
  CollectionHall_126989_Desc = {
    Text = "Her true origin is now beyond verification; the earliest, most fragmented records of this ancient \"deity\" date back thousands of years.\nNo two eyes see her the same. She alters memory without a trace, weaving her image into the minds of those who look upon her until they believe she is the only thing that has ever mattered.\nUnlike most other Awakeners, she is almost entirely void of human emotion or sentiment.\nShe is a thought, a delirious whim, a wisp of drifting mist. To some, she is Xu; to others, Liu, Li, Qian, or Zhang. She is born of Rapture and pursues the endless pleasure derived from Chaos.\nYet she is not entirely beyond comprehension. To those she favors—those who grant her the utmost delight—she may reveal a glimpse of her true name, a name that does not shift or fade like the rest:\n\nQiān Shàn Xuán Nǚ, <Italic:\"The Obsidian Matriarch of Thousand Fans\">."
  },
