  CollectionHall_142161_Title = {
    Text = "Original Sin"
  },
  CollectionHall_142162_Desc = {
    Text = [[
There is a plant called the dandelion, which lets its seeds drift away upon the wind.
The downy seeds wander wherever the wind carries them, far, so very far from the soil that bore them.
When does such a lonely seed decide where it belongs?
...It is the moment when, somewhere in the desert, one single person happens to love that dandelion.]]
  },
  CollectionHall_142162_LockTip = {
    Text = "Clear Multiverse Link \"Forgotten Seed of Love\""
  },
  CollectionHall_142162_Title = {
    Text = "Where the Dandelions Go"
  },
  CollectionHall_142163_Desc = {
    Text = [[
A boundless world, an endless sea of sand.
A no-man's-land that belongs to none but you and me.
An eternal, unfettered odyssey of love.]]
  },
  CollectionHall_142163_LockTip = {
    Text = "Clear Multiverse Link \"Forgotten Seed of Love\""
