    Text = "Back when I was still the lowliest of servants, I once bore witness to a campaign of utter cruelty.\nThat legendary master—power forged her very flesh and bone, her seething blood became an undying flame, and that firelight in turn set her eyes ablaze—\nKeep this memory alive for me, my child... In the end, she triumphed, and conquered the sea of stars."
