  CollectionHall_48611_Desc = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Physical Dimension>
The Dimension in which matter exists, the "Real World" of human daily life. 
In the Physical Dimension, space is three-dimensional, time is linear, and matter is tangible, while emotions and spirit remain abstract and invisible. 
Everything seems so natural, as if incomprehensible things never existed.

<Title:Spirit Dimension>
The dimension where spirits resides, also called the "Dream Dimension."
In the Spirit Dimension, emotions, memories, and obsessions can form distinct entities. 
Besides spirits of individuals from the Physical Dimension, various Spirit Dimension Entities also reside here. These beings are difficult to observe with the naked eye and can only be detected with special instruments or by exploring Domains.]]
  },
  CollectionHall_48611_Title = {Text = "Dimension"},
  CollectionHall_48612_Desc = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Definition and Features>
A phenomenon where a substance undergoes special Dissolution. 
Most humans, except for a few individuals, cannot observe the D-Phenomenon with the naked eye. 
As Dissolution progresses, the existence of those affected will be erased, including life traces, written records, and related memories. 
They will be forgotten by the world.

<Title:Transmission>
The transmission route is unknown. 
The appearance and disappearance of Dissolution seem random and unpredictable. It can only spread through specific methods, such as special rituals or relics.

<Title:Intervention>
Only Silver and their products can intervene and provide healing. 
Most affected individuals are highly susceptible to Dissolution and can be intervened with Silver Products before complete disintegration. 
A few individuals exhibit resistance but suffer irreversible mental damage, which cannot be restored even with Silver Products. Effective intervention methods for these cases remain undiscovered.]]
  },
  CollectionHall_48612_Title = {
    Text = "Dissolution"
  },
  CollectionHall_48614_Title = {Text = "Gateway"},
  CollectionHall_48616_Desc = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Founding Date>
A.F.187; its predecessor, Mythag College, was founded in A.F.90.

<Title:Founders>
Ward Phillips, Khlarcus, Tawil.

<Title:Overview>
A specialized University dedicated to combating Dissolution. 
It is a third-party entity independent of any National Government, refusing to participate in political struggles or belong to any Faction. 
Its entire faculty, students, and staff total just over a thousand people. It offers standard courses in economics, humanities, and sciences, alongside special courses for Investigators, Keepers, and Awakeners. 
The main campus is located in the Kingdom of Leo. It dispatches research teams, alongside Investigators and Keepers, to address D-Phenomena globally. 
It is a unique institution that values both theory and practice, imposing severe consequences for failing courses.]]
  },
