  CollectionHall_48619_Desc = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Founding Date>
A.F.186

<Title:Founder>
Signatory Countries of the "Mystia Treaty"

<Title:Overview>
A Global Organization composed of ordinary humans. 
Established with funding from various National Governments, it operates independently and serves as the official manager and first responder to D-Phenomena. 
Most members are ordinary individuals without a background in Mysticism or supernatural abilities, with the primary and sole objective being to combat Dissolution. 
Numerous offices have been established in various countries, each responsible for different regions. 
"Solemn and rigid" are everyone's first impressions of the Organization, with their overly bleached white uniforms appearing as stiff as their posture.]]
