  CollectionHall_48635_Desc = {
    Text = "Current steward of Mythag University and former student of Crowley MacKinnon, serving as Herbert's immediate junior.\nShe witnessed Herbert murder their mentor in silence and has managed college affairs in the deceased instructor's stead ever since.\nA ruthless efficiency maximalist—never late, with cropped hair to minimize grooming time.\nSmuggled into the Kingdom of Leo from war-torn Elke, the immobility of her right index finger stands as permanent evidence of concentration camp brutality."
