  CollectionHall_51019_Desc = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Founding Date>
Before the Flood

<Title:Founder>
Unknown

<Title:Overview>
A nomadic people that splintered from the Assyrian Empire.
Hidden amidst the severe storms of the Remouahe Desert, they live in a very primitive manner, seldom communicating with outsiders. The Aramites worship the "Mother Tree of Abundance," relying on its extraordinary reproductive abilities alongside the holy river water to maintain their population scale.
After the "Remouahe Incident," the Aramites vanished without a trace, with no further news.]]
  },
