    Text = "The Unknowable"
  },
  CollectionHall_51374_Desc = {
    Text = "Nobleman, social activist, and Mythag's most enigmatic educator.\nThis reformed playboy once dabbled in petty crimes while cultivating reputations in both high society and its underworld. After cultists annihilated his family, he alone survived—the details known only to him.\nThough Ramona's adoptive father, he refuses to discuss her origins.\nHe failed every course as a youth yet became a Mythag professor. Charismatic and unbound by convention, yet conspicuously absent from romantic gossip. In short, this is a man full of paradox."
  },
  CollectionHall_51374_LockTip = {
    Text = "Clear Prologue"
  },
  CollectionHall_51374_Title = {Text = "Dexter"},
  CollectionHall_51375_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Dexter's adopted daughter and the Keeper's most reliable partner.
Raised wandering Mythag's lecture halls, she possesses encyclopedic knowledge of the Dissolution Phenomenon and Awakener technology.
Once yearned for biological parents, but under Dexter's care and the faculty's guidance, she now considers Mythag her true home.
Her calm rationality and measured kindness make her strikingly normal amidst Mythag's eccentrics. The perpetual coldness in her expression? Merely the fatigue of genius.]]
  },
