  CollectionHall_89706_Desc = {
    Text = "Orphan of unknown origin, Corposant was taken in by crew members since the beginning of her memory and lived aboard a ship.\nBecause of this experience, Corposant has harbored a deep longing and curiosity for the Deep Sea since childhood.\nWhen she grew up, she naturally chose a career related to the Deep Sea and ships—pilot.\nFrom then on, the maiden who loves the Deep Sea would eternally drift upon the waves, guiding ships beneath a canopy of stars.\nShe was \"born\" upon the sea, upon the ship.\nShe also fears no \"death\" upon the sea, upon her ship.\nThis is how she is destined to live."
  },
