  CollectionHall_89970_Title = {
    Text = "Vengeance in Crimson"
  },
  CollectionHall_89971_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Beneath the blood-red setting sun lies yellow sand soaked in blood.
The strongest warrior stands on the battlefield about to sink into the night, reminiscing about the golden flames and glory of old.
Countless screaming vultures rise, blocking the last rays of sunlight. In the great eastern expedition, the desert is filled with the undead, accompanying him in his burial.]]
