  },
  CollectionHall_89975_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Every time she sets sail, she is prepared with the latest will.
The song that has been passed down through generations acts like a lullaby in a dream, gently embracing her soul.
The bright flags flutter in the wind; her flesh may crumble, rot, or sink into the deep sea, but her soul will surely stand upon her ship, sending forth eternal light toward the stars and the sea.]]
