  },
  CollectionHall_89978_Desc = {
    Text = [[
Endless snow falls down, dancing in the air, covering the warriors' hair with frost.
At this moment, her life's memories flow; she walks from the subtle depths of human hearts, heading towards the towering mountains.
Betrayal, abandonment, and protection, all the pain and anger are merely a series of battles. With people, with mountains, and with oneself.
She looks at her leader, at the unfamiliar yet familiar new companions, revealing an awkward smile.
One day she may triumph, or she may fall forever on the battlefield, but even at the moment of ascending to heaven or descending into hell, she will not let go of the blade in her hand.
To prevent losing everything again, this time she chooses to raise the sword of protection before seeking revenge, heading alone to her battlefield.]]
