Between its malformed columns, prismatic fish weave their endless dance.
Your body sinks. Your spirit floats.
You surrender breath willingly, drowning, drowning... Drowning with her in this pearlescent delirium.
It is the ocean's miracle. It is your warm, blue homeland.]]
